        "created_at": "2014-03-14T21:43:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was working on a custom font for a personal project and thought it would be cool to have the (H) icon available. Before long I had that and black &amp; white versions of the Hero Icons (based on the AMAZING work of&nbsp;Jagarciao). &nbsp;Assuming that the GtG guys are OK with it, I would be glad to share the link for the font here (and/or send it to Spiff if he wanted to host it on his AWESOME SotM Resources page).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Just for the record, this font is obviously for personal, non-commercial use only (assuming GtG says it's OK to share it at all). No infringement on GtG's intellectual property rights is intended nor should be inferred.</p>",
