        "id": 95755,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-03-14T22:48:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I found an <a href=\"http://www.myscriptfont.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">online font generator </a>where you download a template, put the stuff you want to be a font into the right spots on the template, then upload the template back to the site and it turns your stuff into an actual font.&nbsp; Using that and a copy of the \"H\" like Christopher has, I was able to make a custom SotM font that includes the \"H\".&nbsp; It also includes the \"SV\", \"EV\", etc. icons that I needed for my oversized cards.</p><p>I posted the font (or maybe a link to it?) in another topic on the forum where we discussed this very topic.&nbsp; Maybe with a little digging, you could find it if you were interested.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
