        "raw": "<p>I found an <a href=\"http://www.myscriptfont.com/\">online font generator </a>where you download a template, put the stuff you want to be a font into the right spots on the template, then upload the template back to the site and it turns your stuff into an actual font.&nbsp; Using that and a copy of the &quot;H&quot; like Christopher has, I was able to make a custom SotM font that includes the &quot;H&quot;.&nbsp; It also includes the &quot;SV&quot;, &quot;EV&quot;, etc. icons that I needed for my oversized cards.</p><p>I posted the font (or maybe a link to it?) in another topic on the forum where we discussed this very topic.&nbsp; Maybe with a little digging, you could find it if you were interested.</p>",
